# User journeys and states

## Users and tasks
Describe evidenced personas or operator/developer jobs.

## Journey flows
Use Mermaid flows with stable FLOW-### IDs where useful.

## Form placement and overlays
Use a page/route for primary or multi-field forms and inline fields for short contextual tasks. Do not default to modal/popup forms; record any explicit exception and accessible fallback.

## Interaction states
Document loading, empty, populated, success, error and recovery states per primary view.

## Accessibility and recovery
Cover keyboard, screen reader, cancellation, retry and partial failure as applicable.
